Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-t-t-t-t
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-t
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's enough crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And enough sitting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all fighting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to come back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have been dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a moment there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.91,0:00:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we actually had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:01:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, so what did that shark\Nguy just do? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.19,0:01:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like he was just\Nthrowing water around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then they both started to bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even have to touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You humans are so fragile\Nthat I can kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just by playing around\Nwith a little water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the difference between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.57,0:01:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the shark\Nis king of the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.51,0:01:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.49,0:01:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your lives are not worth that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one who will\Nmiss you when you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:01:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just teaching one final lesson\Nto these pathetic little pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power.
