Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.91,0:02:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nhe'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only legendary until\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:04:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.12,0:04:09.04,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)}My Turn
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.12,0:04:09.04,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}My Turn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hasn't you learned your lesson\Nyet how many times have you tried
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To kill me in these last eight years,\Num, you've tried assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,um
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be aware that you\Nmere humans can't kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, listen. I won't put you in the\Nground, Nami. But you can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will remain here, with\Nus, as our surveyor, forever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm quite good-natured If possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to be our\Nsurveyor of your own free will
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not take pause in having my fishmen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill every living creature on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's only if you\Nrefuse to come back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong Pirates and draw sea\Nsharks as one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you decide to come back with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be kind and spare\Nthe villagers' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't let these ingrates live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be made an example of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's only one question!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you come with me and save\Nthe people of Cocoyashi village?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or be foolish and refuse my\Nrequest by fighting alongside them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With them you will be hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With them you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you come and stand by my side?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The decision is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remain friends with Luffy and\Nthe others, everyone will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I go with Arlong, everyone\Nfrom the village will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their lives depend on my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what she chooses,\Nhe'll never set her free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.35,0:06:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to believe in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, we'll\Nfight to the death, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, it looks like\Nthey've made up their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Liv! Please, Liv!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, now just remove his leg weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:07:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a fountain over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that rubber man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting anywhere near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to\Nnever say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I kick and break that\Nleg weight, he can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:09:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're the only\None who can fight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one with Devil Fruit powers is supposed\Nto lose even the energy to struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention his powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he's still alive,\Nwell, that wouldn't be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Lisa, you're fine! Sure, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you scared us where'd your pinwheel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go it was cool we've got bigger things\Nto worry about right now wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be fair this game hasn't been fair\Nfrom the moment we started playing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it well anyways if there's a hindrance\NI should be aware of it correct
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro Usopp, he's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he got here just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat one of their\Nleaders, can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wiped the smug off his stupid face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, is there any way\Nyou can free yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The energy is way too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C'mon! C'mon! C'mon! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if they can just\Nset Big Bro Luffy free,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fishmen will be running\Nfor their lives! Go, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take down Arlong once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we have to somehow prevent\NArlong from getting into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just keep him from going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you have your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Harlong, I've got a present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to keep standing in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you wish to die first, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is a piece of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a proud nose\Nbecause it's unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were in full strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may have been able to\Ngive it a little scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there. That damn octopus is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one I was aiming for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But weren't you yelling Arlong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.61,0:12:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have put me down,\Nbut it wasn't for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm still alive and now\NI'm gonna finish off your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to be concerned seeing as\Nhow you will all be dead anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done enough, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll break the rock with a kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Octopus-Fla-Renzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thoreau!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all these bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have a good fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's breathing. How can\Nhe still be alive with a body like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dying already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I fighting a wounded man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.23,0:14:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to die right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a person stays put,\Ntheir wounds won't open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you find your situation amusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.11,0:15:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the Octoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll win this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one that made this\Ncomplicated in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to take care of that shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they free you? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hero back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That rubber bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, just a warm one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can actually beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were better off\Ndrowning on the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it up here. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not understand my anger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw my brothers crushed like worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll realize soon enough that you\Nshould have quit fighting a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Luffy's gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Arlong doesn't seem to be\Naffected by his attacks at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, just how\Nfar away do you think Zoro flew?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got your back, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he loses, then we'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happens, it's the\Nend of the East Blue, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.91,0:19:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the biggest difference\Nbetween you and me is our noses?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um what's he doing uh
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know webbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.81,0:19:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Species!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that had to be painful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.57,0:19:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His teeth must be shattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see this is the\Ninherent power of this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you, pathetic humans,\Nhaving been created with such limited power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been on a different level than\Nyou since the beginning of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being such inferior creatures, it makes\Nperfect sense for you to bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way a human could\Ndo something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those jaws got a hold of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they would do a lot more than\Njust leave some bite marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll snap through your\Nbones like a butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not that awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, smashing stones with\Nyour teeth isn't that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.57,0:21:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, you're the best, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell it like it is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What idiot bites a rock anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every member of the human\Nrace is ignorant and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good are you if you can't even\Npull yourself out of the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I'm worthless\Nwithout my friends to help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:21:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's a swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it isn't swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just flailing about\Nlike a child playing pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you realize this isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.39,0:22:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just shattered our mom's tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.66,0:23:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue how to\Nuse a sword, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what exactly is\Nhe trying to say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.29,0:23:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a terrible sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely can't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't even lie! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And without my friends to help me, I\Nwould have been dead a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you fully admit how pathetic you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.29,0:23:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be a fool, but\Nyou certainly are honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How must your crew feel tolerating\Nthis idiocy day in and day out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that makes me wonder why they tried so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.93,0:23:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,desperately to save their half-wit leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.63,0:23:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like you doesn't\Ndeserve a ship or a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good is a helpless\Nrubber-brained captain to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.03,0:23:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, get to it, you numbskull.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.33,0:24:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he dies, I'm going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.35,0:24:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.53,0:24:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let it be!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.47,0:24:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.01,0:24:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheer all you want, but\Nit won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.69,0:24:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got no teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.29,0:24:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New teeth will grow one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.25,0:24:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with each set, they\Nbecome stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.89,0:24:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.17,0:24:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As many as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.33,0:24:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is but one of the many\Ngifts we fistmen possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.93,0:25:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you haven't yet realized that these\Nmen are superior, you will very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.95,0:25:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tooth, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.07,0:25:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's roll, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.79,0:25:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our long leaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.83,0:25:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.91,0:25:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.81,0:25:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead, you stretchy freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.07,0:25:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you use my injured\Nbrother as a shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.51,0:26:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.55,0:26:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who attacked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.03,0:26:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember that was pretty scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.99,0:26:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move a muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.67,0:26:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.51,0:26:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.42,0:26:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's an interesting idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.09,0:26:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.71,0:26:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in his brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.75,0:26:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.51,0:26:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With some secret scheme?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.33,0:26:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:26:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.00,0:26:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.03,0:27:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in crushing my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.37,0:27:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.13,0:27:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, Luffy, that\Ncan't be very sanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.59,0:27:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.50,0:27:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have short teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long do you intend\Nto keep fooling around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.17,0:27:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stop playing games!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.47,0:27:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.33,0:27:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.11,0:28:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.49,0:28:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.69,0:28:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we're even!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.85,0:28:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you used my tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your puny jaws aren't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, sharp as my teeth are,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're only useful when they\Ncome with powerful jaws like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.67,0:28:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're DEADLY!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.57,0:28:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.69,0:28:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro's gonna lose his arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's in my heart confuses\Nme, I cannot understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.41,0:29:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I face what I must do, I'll\Nsay goodbye and squeeze your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.45,0:29:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll set sail alone, but always\Nknow I'm dying, I'll keep you near.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.43,0:29:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I drift away, I pray you\Nwatch me as I disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.45,0:29:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watched the sunrise,\NI began to wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.17,0:29:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could be the reason\Nit's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.29,0:29:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.95,0:29:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.23,0:29:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings,\Nget them to come back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.11,0:29:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must because\Nthey're everything I want of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrap these arms around my dreams\Nand pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.71,0:29:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make a way!

